# NOTE: auto-fix-task.md is intentionally NOT listed here. bobshell treats
# .gitignore as its own tool-read ignore list, and would refuse to read this
# file via its normal read_file tool if it were ignored. It's deleted right
# after each run (see run_claude() in claude_auto_fix.py) so it never
# actually lingers to be committed.

